  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\nGiven statement : 85 - 28 × 3 + 114 ÷ 6 = 150 \n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the signs :\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : + and ×\n\n85 - 28 × 3 + 114 ÷ 6 = 150 ⇒ 85 - 28 + 3 × **114 ÷ 6**__ = 150\n\n85 - 28 + __**3 × **____19__ = 150 \n\n__**85 + 57**__ - 28 = 150\n\n__**142 - 28**__ = 150\n\n114 ≠ 150 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : - and ÷ \n\n85 - 28 × 3 + 114 ÷ 6 = 150 ⇒ **85 ÷ 28**__ × 3 + 114 - 6 = 150\n\n__**3.03 × 3**__ + 114 - 6 = 150\n\n__**27 + 114**__ - 6 = 150\n\n__**141 - 6**__ = 150\n\n135 ≠ 150 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : ÷ and ×\n\n85 - 28 × 3 + 114 ÷ 6 = 150 ⇒ 85 - **28 ÷ 3**__ + 114 × 6 = 150\n\n85 - 9 + __**114 × 6**__ = 150\n\n__**85 + 684**__ - 9 = 150\n\n__**769 - 9**__ = 150\n\n760 ≠ 150 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : + and -\n\n85 - 28 × 3 + 114 ÷ 6 = 150 ⇒ 85 + 28 × 3 - **114 ÷ 6**__ = 150\n\n85 + __**28 × 3**__ - 19 = 150\n\n__**85 + 84**__ - 19 = 150\n\n__**169 - 19**__ = 150\n\n**150 = 150 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nHence, \"Option - (4)\" is the correct answer.",
